---Describes the Build step of the function that builds a container from the given source.
---@class gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2BuildConfig
---@field environmentVariables? gcp.run_v2.StringMap Optional. User-provided build-time environment variables for the function
---@field name? string Output only. The Cloud Build name of the latest successful deployment of the function.
---@field workerPool? string Optional. Name of the Cloud Build private pool that should be used to build the Cloud Run function. The format of this field is `projects/{project}/locations/{region}/workerPools/{workerPool}` where `{project}` and `{region}` are the project id and region respectively where the worker pool is defined and `{workerPool}` is the short name of the worker pool.
---@field functionTarget? string Optional. The name of the function (as defined in source code) that will be executed. Defaults to the resource name suffix, if not specified. For backward compatibility, if function with given name is not found, then the system will try to use function named "function".
---@field imageUri? string Optional. Artifact Registry URI to store the built image.
---@field sourceLocation? string The Cloud Storage bucket URI where the function source code is located.
---@field baseImage? string Optional. The base image used to build the function.
---@field enableAutomaticUpdates? boolean Optional. Sets whether the function will receive automatic base image updates.
---@field serviceAccount? string Optional. Service account to be used for building the container. The format of this field is `projects/{projectId}/serviceAccounts/{serviceAccountEmail}`.

