---@field reason? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2ConditionReasonEnum|string Output only. A common (service-level) reason for this condition.
---@field instanceReason? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2ConditionInstanceReasonEnum|string Output only. A reason for the instance condition.

