---A single application container. This specifies both the container to run, the command to run in the container and the arguments to supply to it. Note that additional arguments can be supplied by the system to the container at runtime.
---@class gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2Container
---@field ports? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2ContainerPortList List of ports to expose from the container. Only a single port can be specified. The specified ports must be listening on all interfaces (0.0.0.0) within the container to be accessible. If omitted, a port number will be chosen and passed to the container through the PORT environment variable for the container to listen on.
---@field sandboxLauncher? boolean Optional. Indicates that this container can act as a sandbox supervisor and launch sandboxes.
---@field env? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2EnvVarList List of environment variables to set in the container.
---@field sourceCode? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2SourceCode Optional. Location of the source. This field is only supported in Cloud Run Service.
---@field buildConfig? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2BuildConfiguration Optional. The build configuration for the container image.
---@field livenessProbe? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2Probe Periodic probe of container liveness. Container will be restarted if the probe fails.
---@field name? string Name of the container specified as a DNS_LABEL (RFC 1123).
---@field image? string Required. Name of the container image in Dockerhub, Google Artifact Registry, or Google Container Registry. If the host is not provided, Dockerhub is assumed.
---@field workingDir? string Container's working directory. If not specified, the container runtime's default will be used, which might be configured in the container image.
---@field readinessProbe? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2Probe Readiness probe to be used for health checks.
---@field startupProbe? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2Probe Startup probe of application within the container. All other probes are disabled if a startup probe is provided, until it succeeds. Container will not be added to service endpoints if the probe fails.
---@field buildInfo? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2BuildInfo Output only. The build info of the container image.
---@field dependsOn? gcp.run_v2.StringList Names of the containers that must start before this container.
---@field command? gcp.run_v2.StringList Entrypoint array. Not executed within a shell. The docker image's ENTRYPOINT is used if this is not provided.
---@field args? gcp.run_v2.StringList Arguments to the entrypoint. The docker image's CMD is used if this is not provided.
---@field resources? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2ResourceRequirements Compute Resource requirements by this container.
---@field baseImageUri? string Base image for this container. Only supported for services. If set, it indicates that the service is enrolled into automatic base image update.
---@field volumeMounts? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2VolumeMountList Volume to mount into the container's filesystem.

