---@field updateTime? string Output only. The last-modified time.
---@field sandboxes? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2SandboxConfiguration Configuration for sandboxes.
---@field name? string Output only. The unique name of this Task.
---@field conditions? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2ConditionList Output only. The Condition of this Task, containing its readiness status, and detailed error information in case it did not reach the desired state.
---@field reconciling? boolean Output only. Indicates whether the resource's reconciliation is still in progress. See comments in `Job.reconciling` for additional information on reconciliation process in Cloud Run.
---@field index? number Output only. Index of the Task, unique per execution, and beginning at 0.
