---@field vpcAccess? gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2VpcAccess Output only. VPC Access configuration to use for this Task. For more information, visit https://cloud.google.com/run/docs/configuring/connecting-vpc.
---@field completionTime? string Output only. Represents time when the Task was completed. It is not guaranteed to be set in happens-before order across separate operations.

