---@field subPath? string Optional. Path within the volume from which the container's volume should be mounted. Defaults to "" (volume's root). This field is currently rejected in Secret volume mounts.

---@alias gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2VolumeMountList gcp.run_v2.GoogleCloudRunV2VolumeMount[]

